  "level": "A1",
  "description": "Make simple negative sentences with ne before a present-tense verb.",
  "grammar_note": "To make a simple present-tense sentence negative, put ne immediately before the verb: Radim. → Ne radim. (I work. → I don’t work.) The verb keeps the same ending. For example: Ne razumijem. (I don’t understand.) Ne govorim hrvatski. (I don’t speak Croatian.)",
